  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe quick plan now selects the app suites that post the shipped examples. The trigger is a diff that touches one of these paths:\n\n- `assets/posts/` (a `.cps` post script)\n- `assets/machines/`\n- `examples/` (also `examples/catalog/**`)\n- `crates/post/src/` and `crates/motion/src/` (the post and toolpath engines; this fits as two entries of the same table, so no redesign)\n\nThe new rule is in `xtask/src/example_suites.rs` (`INPUTS`, `SUITES`, `map`). `quick.rs` calls it in place of `catalog::map_catalog`. `map` calls `map_catalog` first, so the catalog reason of #2393 stays. The heavy reach (`heavy.rs`) does not change.\n\nSelected app suites (`app suites: <name>`, each only if the binary exists):\n\n- `example_catalog`, `example_catalog_adaptive`, `example_catalog_edge_work`, `first_part_programs` (the issue)\n- `first_router_part` (posts `examples/first-router-part.camproj`)\n- `first_4axis_part`, `continuous_4axis_part`, `tilt_basis_compat` (compare a shipped `.nc`)\n- `catalog_groove_part_off` (reads a posted catalog case)\n\nNot added: `agie_native` (it reads `examples/agie` only as input). The UI suites `catalog_render`, `egui_app` and `gpu_render` render example projects but post nothing. The decision is in `docs/decisions/3521-gate-selects-example-posts.md`.\n\nThe gate skill (`.claude/skills/gate/SKILL.md`, \"What quick selects\") has a new item for the rule. `AGENTS.md` is not changed: \"Heavy lanes at review\" stays true.\n\n## Dry run: `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main --dry-run`, scratch change to `assets/posts/grblhal.cps`\n\n- Before (origin/main 16dc39f06): 57 steps. No `example_catalog*` step, no `first_part_programs` step. Only `first_router_part` (it names `grblhal.cps`).\n- After: 66 steps. New steps: `app suites: catalog_groove_part_off`, `continuous_4axis_part`, `example_catalog`, `example_catalog_adaptive`, `example_catalog_edge_work`, `first_4axis_part`, `first_part_programs`, `tilt_basis_compat`. The reason line is `assets/posts/grblhal.cps can change a shipped example (#3521)`.\n\n## Pinning tests (`xtask/src/example_suites_tests.rs`, 7 tests)\n\n- `a_post_script_change_selects_the_shipped_example_suites` (`assets/posts/grblhal.cps` -> the four steps)\n- `a_machine_file_change_selects_the_shipped_example_suites`\n- `a_shipped_program_change_selects_first_part_programs` (`examples/first-router-part.nc`)\n- `a_catalog_case_change_selects_every_catalog_suite`\n- `a_post_engine_change_selects_the_shipped_example_suites` (`crates/post/src/post/cnc.rs`)\n- `a_docs_only_change_selects_no_shipped_example_suite`\n- `every_listed_example_suite_exists`\n\n## Gate (xtask only)\n\n- `cargo test -p xtask --bin xtask example_suites`: 7 passed\n- `asset_tests`: 5 passed; `heavy_plan_tests`: 11 passed; `light_tests`: 6 passed\n- `catalog_tests::pdf_command_builders_and_quick_gate_catalog_mapping`: 1 passed\n- the `tests::` and `step_tests::` modules (exact names): 26 passed\n- `cargo clippy -j 6 -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean\n\nNot exercised: the rest of the xtask binary (its catalog tests build the app CLI), and the selected app suites themselves (no app build).\n\n## Left for #3557\n\nThe wider selection problem is #3557: the quick plan falls back to the whole batch plan, and other inputs reach suites by name only. This PR does not change that. The list in `SUITES` is fixed. A discovery of the readers of `examples/` from the test text also belongs to #3557.\n\nProcess change: yes\nEffort: medium\nChangelog: none\n\nRefs #3557\nRefs #3572\nFixes #3521\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
